## Android SDK (required by the Android Gradle Plugin)
## sdk.dir=/Users/YOU/Library/Android/sdk

## RevenueCat public SDK keys — copy this file to local.properties (gitignored).
## Never commit the real key. Debug builds use the Test Store key (`test_…`).
## Release builds must use a Play key (`goog_…`); a test_ key is stripped from release.
#
# revenuecat.androidApiKey=test_YOUR_TEST_STORE_KEY
# revenuecat.playApiKey=goog_YOUR_PLAY_SDK_KEY
